# L §5.10 Kind and unit: "a quantity unit (unit hour …, §5.4), a compound unit such as PLN/year and a plain number are
# keys of no unit kind, so unit of such a place or quantity is refused (§8.4): at load where load sees it (LOAD-UNIT)".
# unit(n_units), n_units a plain num.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2024-12-31
  start 2024-01-01
  end 2024-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind notes: unit
kind brokerages: place any min 0
kind trades: event certain
  leg units: notes
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
place market: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input n_units: num
input amt: money PLN
input day: date

move buy: trades
  on day
  leg units from market to mbank amount n_units * 1 fund_x
  leg cash from konto to market amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2024-01-01
  notes + [fund_x] lives 2000-01-01..
  brokerages + [mbank] lives 2010-01-01..
  n_units = 10
  amt = 1 000.00 PLN
  day = 2024-03-01
  opening[konto] = 5 000.00 PLN at 2024-01-01 start

ask q: unit(n_units)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT unit of num: a plain number ...
